<title>THAILAND: Thailand 1996 c/a deficit narrows to 8 pct of GDP.</title>
<headline>Thailand 1996 c/a deficit narrows to 8 pct of GDP.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's 1996 current account deficit narrowed marginally to 8.0 percent of gross domestic product from 8.1 percent of gdp in 1995, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deficit has been a source of worry for the Thai government and a concern among foreign investors.</p>
<p>The central bank had earlier expected the deficit to be 8.2 percent of gdp in 1996.</p>
</text>
